# Heavy, regenerable PID R2025a simulation outputs.
# Keep the lightweight, human-readable artifacts (PNGs, *_metrics.csv,
# *_tables.mat, PID_ANALYSIS_REPORT.md); skip the large raw data, which is
# reproducible from the committed models/params/build scripts.
Matlab/Simulations_Quad_results/**/*_timeseries.csv
Matlab/Simulations_Quad_results/**/*_simout.mat
Matlab/Simulations_Quad_results/**/*_signals.mat
